 "text": "Hi, how have you been? That's annoying, but cats often do random things like that. Is your keyboard in a spot she can't jump on top of? That works for a few minutes. She' be bored and lonely, and it' only last a day or two. Move the keyboard to high shelf where she can't reach, and give her more playtime. Move the keyboard, and tell the kittens the story about the brave bird. The kittens love a little tale. She' be happy to see you. Bring the box of cat food, and ask her what she wants to eat. Keep the box on your lap, and use the cats' feeding routine to time the meeting. They' soon be back to normal. She will. Move the keyboard, and the keyboard walking will stop entirely.",
